+* a relay, a cross-border tunnel. Retrying five times behind a 120s upstream
+* timeout turns one stuck request into many minutes of silence, so the
+* OpenHarmony host retries once and surfaces the failure instead.
+* DSH_OHOS_MAX_RETRIES raises the budget (up to the upstream default of 5).
+*/
